{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2023-05-04 08:45:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED INCREASES ITS PRIME RATE TO 8.25 PERCENT', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO\xa0, MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: HBAN) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS PRIME RATE IS INCREASING FROM 8 PERCENT TO 8.25 PERCENT, EFFECTIVE MAY 4, 2023. THE RATE WAS LAST CHANGED ON MARCH 23, 2023, WHEN HUNTINGTON INCREASED IT FROM 7.75 PERCENT TO 8 PERCENT.'}